jei.arsenal.morning_star.title=§6§lMorning Star
jei.arsenal.morning_star.1=§7Hold attack to charge a stronger sweeping hit.
jei.arsenal.morning_star.2=§eEach charge quarter adds +10% damage.
jei.arsenal.morning_star.3=§4Full charge inflicts Armor Fracture and may Stun.

jei.arsenal.scimitar.title=§6§lScimitar
jei.arsenal.scimitar.1=§7Fast one-handed weapon. Dual wield matching Scimitars to alternate attacks.
jei.arsenal.scimitar.2=§bHold use while paired to cross-guard; attack while guarding to shield bash.

jei.arsenal.claws.title=§6§lClaws
jei.arsenal.claws.1=§7Equip matching Claws to unlock paired combat.
jei.arsenal.claws.2=§bHold left/right click to auto-attack with the corresponding hand.
jei.arsenal.claws.3=§8Fully charged paired hits can pierce ordinary invulnerability frames.

jei.arsenal.flail.title=§6§lFlail
jei.arsenal.flail.1=§bHold attack to swing continuously.
jei.arsenal.flail.2=§7Hits visible enemies around the wielder; reach and attack-speed modifiers apply.

jei.arsenal.battering_ram.title=§6§lBattering Ram
jei.arsenal.battering_ram.1=§bHold use with an empty offhand to charge forward.
jei.arsenal.battering_ram.2=§7Normal attacks deal extra knockback. Charging can break configured blocks.
jei.arsenal.battering_ram.3=§cTwo-Handed

jei.arsenal.ball_and_chain.title=§6§lBall and Chain
jei.arsenal.ball_and_chain.1=§bHold attack to wind up; release to throw.
jei.arsenal.ball_and_chain.2=§7Higher rotations increase throw reach and damage.
jei.arsenal.ball_and_chain.3=§8An empty offhand permits guarding.

jei.arsenal.blade_staff.title=§6§lBlade Staff
jei.arsenal.blade_staff.1=§7Melee hits sweep nearby enemies.
jei.arsenal.blade_staff.2=§bRight click to reflect incoming damage for 1 second.
jei.arsenal.blade_staff.3=§8Reflection strength and durability cost depend on material tier.

jei.defenders.defender.title=§6§lDefender
jei.defenders.defender.1=§7An offensive offhand guard that adds melee damage and attack speed.
jei.defenders.defender.2=§bHold use to parry, then continue holding for guarded damage reduction.
jei.defenders.defender.3=§ePerfect parries knock enemies back and apply Slowness and Vulnerable.

jei.arsenal.tartsy_shield.title=§6§lTartsy Shield
jei.arsenal.tartsy_shield.1=§bNegates one hit, then enters a short recovery cooldown.
jei.arsenal.tartsy_shield.2=§7Attack while guarding to dash, gain brief immunity and Stun a confirmed target.

jei.arsenal.sun_war_bulwark.title=§6§lSun-War Bulwark
jei.arsenal.sun_war_bulwark.1=§bBlocks attacks from every direction and grants passive damage reduction while ready.
jei.arsenal.sun_war_bulwark.2=§7Guard and attack for an armor-scaled area bash.
jei.arsenal.sun_war_bulwark.3=§cRequires both hands free to guard.

